  "code": "use IO.Std.write_line\nuse Ghul.Pipes\n\nlet doors = (1::100) |> map(_ => false) |> collect_list()\n\nfor pass in 1::100 do\n    let door mut = pass\n\n    while door <= 100 do\n        doors[door - 1] = !doors[door - 1]\n        door = door + pass\n    od\nod\n\nlet open_doors = (1::100) |> filter(door => doors[door - 1])\n\nwrite_line(\"open doors: {$open_doors}\");",
